{"id":"e5fc9ff70d8260ec","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md","title":"Complex Grassmannian Model and Normalization","display":"df-complex-grassmannian-data — Complex Grassmannian Model and Normalization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data","aliases":["58-df-complex-grassmannian-data"],"display":"df-complex-grassmannian-data — Complex Grassmannian Model and Normalization","depends_on":["[[58-df-cohomology-realization.md]]","[[58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md]]","[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-complex-grassmannian-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complex-grassmannian-data — Complex Grassmannian Model and Normalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"213ce75a48289483\" href=\"?note=213ce75a48289483\" title=\"58-df-cohomology-realization.md\">58-df-cohomology-realization.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^{(\\omega)}=\\{v\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega:|\\{i\\in\\omega:v(i)\\neq0\\}|&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathbb C^{(\\omega)}=\\{v\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega:|\\{i\\in\\omega:v(i)\\neq0\\}|&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^{[m]}=\\{v\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega:\\forall i\\in\\omega\\setminus m\\;v(i)=0\\}\">\\(\\mathbb C^{[m]}=\\{v\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega:\\forall i\\in\\omega\\setminus m\\;v(i)=0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}v=\\{i\\in\\omega:v(i)\\neq0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}v=\\{i\\in\\omega:v(i)\\neq0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{ij}=P(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\">\\(P_{ij}=P(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline z\">\\(\\overline z\\)</span> 为复共轭，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|z|^2=z\\overline z\">\\(|z|^2=z\\overline z\\)</span>；复向量运算逐坐标进行。所有矩阵和向量和式均在明确有限的指标集上求和。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{n,m},G_n,\\tau_{G_n},T_{n,m},T_n,\\tau_{T_n},\\pi_n^0\">\\(G_{n,m},G_n,\\tau_{G_n},T_{n,m},T_n,\\tau_{T_n},\\pi_n^0\\)</span> 分别由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_n\">\\(G_n\\)</span> 的矩阵采用共同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\times\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\times\\omega\\)</span> 定义域并在有限方块之外取零。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)\\)</span> 只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}G_n\">\\(P\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}G_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathbb C^{(\\omega)}\">\\(v\\in\\mathbb C^{(\\omega)}\\)</span> 使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=G_1\">\\(L=G_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_L=\\tau_{G_1}\">\\(\\tau_L=\\tau_{G_1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n=L^n\">\\(P_n=L^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{P_n}=\\mathrm{FinitePowerTopology}_S(L,\\tau_L,n)\">\\(\\tau_{P_n}=\\mathrm{FinitePowerTopology}_S(L,\\tau_L,n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i}=\\{\\langle a,a(i)\\rangle:a\\in P_n\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i}=\\{\\langle a,a(i)\\rangle:a\\in P_n\\}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in n\">\\(i\\in n\\)</span>）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>实向量使用有限序数函数编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{r-1}\\rangle_r=\\{\\langle i,x_i\\rangle:i\\in r\\}\">\\(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{r-1}\\rangle_r=\\{\\langle i,x_i\\rangle:i\\in r\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2\">\\(S^2\\)</span> 采用单位球面及其欧氏子空间拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|v\\|=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in3}v(i)^2}\">\\(\\|v\\|=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in3}v(i)^2}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0=\\langle1,1,1\\rangle_3\">\\(v_0=\\langle1,1,1\\rangle_3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1=\\langle-1,1,-1\\rangle_3\">\\(v_1=\\langle-1,1,-1\\rangle_3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_2=\\langle1,-1,-1\\rangle_3\">\\(v_2=\\langle1,-1,-1\\rangle_3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_3=\\langle-1,-1,1\\rangle_3\">\\(v_3=\\langle-1,-1,1\\rangle_3\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{3,i}\">\\(\\delta_{3,i}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_i,c_2,\\chi\">\\(\\sigma_i,c_2,\\chi\\)</span> 为下式给出的函数或链。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}\">\\(\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}\\)</span> 是公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 指示值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm i\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathrm i\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm i^2=-1\">\\(\\mathrm i^2=-1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Im}\\mathrm i=1\">\\(\\operatorname{Im}\\mathrm i=1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^2}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^2,3)\">\\(\\tau_{S^2}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^2,3)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"213ce75a48289483\" href=\"?note=213ce75a48289483\" title=\"58-df-cohomology-realization.md\">58-df-cohomology-realization.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}\">\\(\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}\">\\(\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nG_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{P\\in\\mathbb C^{\\omega\\times\\omega}:{}&amp;\n(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\notin m\\times m\\to P_{ij}=0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall i,j\\in m\\;P_{ij}=\\overline{P_{ji}})\n\\land(\\forall i,j\\in m\\;\\textstyle\\sum_{s\\in m}P_{is}P_{sj}=P_{ij})\n\\land\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in m}P_{ii}=n\\Bigr\\},\\qquad\nG_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}G_{n,m}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nG_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{P\\in\\mathbb C^{\\omega\\times\\omega}:{}&amp;\n(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\notin m\\times m\\to P_{ij}=0))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall i,j\\in m\\;P_{ij}=\\overline{P_{ji}})\n\\land(\\forall i,j\\in m\\;\\textstyle\\sum_{s\\in m}P_{is}P_{sj}=P_{ij})\n\\land\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in m}P_{ii}=n\\Bigr\\},\\qquad\nG_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}G_{n,m}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{G_n}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq G_n:\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall P\\in U\\cap G_{n,m}\\;\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall Q\\in G_{n,m}\\;\n(\\textstyle\\sum_{i,j\\in m}|P_{ij}-Q_{ij}|^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\to Q\\in U)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{G_n}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq G_n:\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall P\\in U\\cap G_{n,m}\\;\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall Q\\in G_{n,m}\\;\n(\\textstyle\\sum_{i,j\\in m}|P_{ij}-Q_{ij}|^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\to Q\\in U)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\textstyle\\sum_{j\\in\\operatorname{supp}v}P_{ij}v(j)\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\textstyle\\sum_{j\\in\\operatorname{supp}v}P_{ij}v(j)\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in G_{n,m}\\times\\mathbb C^{[m]}:\n\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)=v\\},\\qquad\nT_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}T_{n,m},\\\\\n\\pi_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle P,v\\rangle,P\\rangle:\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in T_n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in G_{n,m}\\times\\mathbb C^{[m]}:\n\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)=v\\},\\qquad\nT_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}T_{n,m},\\\\\n\\pi_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle P,v\\rangle,P\\rangle:\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in T_n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{T_n}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq T_n:{}&amp;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in U\\cap T_{n,m}\\;\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall\\langle Q,w\\rangle\\in T_{n,m}\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\textstyle\\sum_{i,j\\in m}|P_{ij}-Q_{ij}|^2+\n\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in m}|v(i)-w(i)|^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\to\\langle Q,w\\rangle\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{T_n}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq T_n:{}&amp;\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in U\\cap T_{n,m}\\;\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall\\langle Q,w\\rangle\\in T_{n,m}\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\textstyle\\sum_{i,j\\in m}|P_{ij}-Q_{ij}|^2+\n\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in m}|v(i)-w(i)|^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\to\\langle Q,w\\rangle\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land a\\in P_n\\to\n\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(a,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle ns+i,nt+j\\rangle,\n\\mathbf1_{\\{i=j\\}}\\,a(i)(\\langle s,t\\rangle)\\bigr\\rangle:\ns,t\\in\\omega\\land i,j\\in n\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(\\varnothing,0)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,0\\rangle:s,t\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GrassmannianSplitting}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(a,n)\\rangle:a\\in P_n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land a\\in P_n\\to\n\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(a,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle ns+i,nt+j\\rangle,\n\\mathbf1_{\\{i=j\\}}\\,a(i)(\\langle s,t\\rangle)\\bigr\\rangle:\ns,t\\in\\omega\\land i,j\\in n\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(\\varnothing,0)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,0\\rangle:s,t\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GrassmannianSplitting}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(a,n)\\rangle:a\\in P_n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ni\\in4\\to\\sigma_i\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,\n\\frac{\\sum_{j\\in4}\\delta_{3,i}(t)(j)v_j}{\\|\\sum_{j\\in4}\\delta_{3,i}(t)(j)v_j\\|}\n\\right\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_2\\right\\},\\\\\nc_2\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in4}(-1)^i\\mathbf1_{\\{s=\\sigma_i\\}}\\rangle:\ns\\in S_2(S^2,\\tau_{S^2})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ni\\in4\\to\\sigma_i\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,\n\\frac{\\sum_{j\\in4}\\delta_{3,i}(t)(j)v_j}{\\|\\sum_{j\\in4}\\delta_{3,i}(t)(j)v_j\\|}\n\\right\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_2\\right\\},\\\\\nc_2\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in4}(-1)^i\\mathbf1_{\\{s=\\sigma_i\\}}\\rangle:\ns\\in S_2(S^2,\\tau_{S^2})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi\\coloneqq\\Biggl\\{\\Biggl\\langle x,\n\\Biggl\\{\\Biggl\\langle\\langle i,j\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\n(1+x(2))/2,&amp;i=j=0,\\\\\n(1-x(2))/2,&amp;i=j=1,\\\\\n(x(0)-\\mathrm i x(1))/2,&amp;i=0\\land j=1,\\\\\n(x(0)+\\mathrm i x(1))/2,&amp;i=1\\land j=0,\\\\\n0,&amp;\\langle i,j\\rangle\\notin2\\times2\n\\end{cases}\n\\Biggr\\rangle:i,j\\in\\omega\\Biggr\\}\n\\Biggr\\rangle:x\\in S^2\\Biggr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi\\coloneqq\\Biggl\\{\\Biggl\\langle x,\n\\Biggl\\{\\Biggl\\langle\\langle i,j\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\n(1+x(2))/2,&amp;i=j=0,\\\\\n(1-x(2))/2,&amp;i=j=1,\\\\\n(x(0)-\\mathrm i x(1))/2,&amp;i=0\\land j=1,\\\\\n(x(0)+\\mathrm i x(1))/2,&amp;i=1\\land j=0,\\\\\n0,&amp;\\langle i,j\\rangle\\notin2\\times2\n\\end{cases}\n\\Biggr\\rangle:i,j\\in\\omega\\Biggr\\}\n\\Biggr\\rangle:x\\in S^2\\Biggr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}_S(u,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,L,\\tau_L)\\land u\\in H_D(2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}_S(S^2,\\tau_{S^2},2)\n\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}_S(\\chi,S^2,\\tau_{S^2},L,\\tau_L,2)(\\Theta_D(2)(u)),\n[c_2]^{\\mathrm h}_{S^2,\\tau_{S^2},2}\n\\right\\rangle\\right)=-1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}_S(u,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,L,\\tau_L)\\land u\\in H_D(2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}_S(S^2,\\tau_{S^2},2)\n\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}_S(\\chi,S^2,\\tau_{S^2},L,\\tau_L,2)(\\Theta_D(2)(u)),\n[c_2]^{\\mathrm h}_{S^2,\\tau_{S^2},2}\n\\right\\rangle\\right)=-1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_n\">\\(G_n\\)</span> 是有限支撑 Hermitian 投影矩阵模型，拓扑是有限维 Grassmann 子空间的弱直极限拓扑，不是未经说明的算子范数拓扑。</li>\n<li>典范丛的纤维向量运算为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle P,v\\rangle+\\langle P,w\\rangle=\\langle P,v+w\\rangle\">\\(\\langle P,v\\rangle+\\langle P,w\\rangle=\\langle P,v+w\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\langle P,v\\rangle=\\langle P,av\\rangle\">\\(a\\langle P,v\\rangle=\\langle P,av\\rangle\\)</span>；下游丛结构使用这些确切运算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_2\">\\(c_2\\)</span> 是含原点的正定向四面体边界径向投影所得的球面基本闭链。所给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 在北极坐标下采用复坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x(0)+\\mathrm i x(1)\">\\(x(0)+\\mathrm i x(1)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>归一化取值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1\">\\(-1\\)</span> 对应典范线丛，而非其对偶的超平面线丛。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 的分裂映射及零秩模型由单独公式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cohomology-realization.md","status":"resolved","id":"213ce75a48289483","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cohomology-realization.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb6796e83e0c5ef4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","