ine z","display":false},{"tex":"G_{n,m},G_n,\\tau_{G_n},T_{n,m},T_n,\\tau_{T_n},\\pi_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"G_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\times\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}G_n","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathbb C^{(\\omega)}","display":false},{"tex":"L=G_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_L=\\tau_{G_1}","display":false},{"tex":"P_n=L^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{P_n}=\\mathrm{FinitePowerTopology}_S(L,\\tau_L,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i}=\\{\\langle a,a(i)\\rangle:a\\in P_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{r-1}\\rangle_r=\\{\\langle i,x_i\\rangle:i\\in r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\|v\\|=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in3}v(i)^2}","display":false},{"tex":"v_0=\\langle1,1,1\\rangle_3","display":false},{"tex":"v_1=\\langle-1,1,-1\\rangle_3","display":false},{"tex":"v_2=\\langle1,-1,-1\\rangle_3","display":false},{"tex":"v_3=\\langle-1,-1,1\\rangle_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{3,i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_i,c_2,\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm i\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm i^2=-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Im}\\mathrm i=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{S^2}=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^2,3)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nG_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{P\\in\\mathbb C^{\\omega\\times\\omega}:{}&\n(\\forall i,j\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\notin m\\times m\\to P_{ij}=0))\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall i,j\\in m\\;P_{ij}=\\overline{P_{ji}})\n\\land(\\forall i,j\\in m\\;\\textstyle\\sum_{s\\in m}P_{is}P_{sj}=P_{ij})\n\\land\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in m}P_{ii}=n\\Bigr\\},\\qquad\nG_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}G_{n,m}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{G_n}\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq G_n:\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall P\\in U\\cap G_{n,m}\\;\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall Q\\in G_{n,m}\\;\n(\\textstyle\\sum_{i,j\\in m}|P_{ij}-Q_{ij}|^2<\\varepsilon^2\\to Q\\in U)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\textstyle\\sum_{j\\in\\operatorname{supp}v}P_{ij}v(j)\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in G_{n,m}\\times\\mathbb C^{[m]}:\n\\mathrm{FiniteMatrixAction}_S(P,v)=v\\},\\qquad\nT_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}T_{n,m},\\\\\n\\pi_n^0\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle P,v\\rangle,P\\rangle:\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in T_n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{T_n}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq T_n:{}&\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\langle P,v\\rangle\\in U\\cap T_{n,m}\\;\n\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall\\langle Q,w\\rangle\\in T_{n,m}\\\\\n&\\bigl(\\textstyle\\sum_{i,j\\in m}|P_{ij}-Q_{ij}|^2+\n\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in m}|v(i)-w(i)|^2<\\varepsilon^2\\to\\langle Q,w\\rangle\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land a\\in P_n\\to\n\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(a,n)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\\langle ns+i,nt+j\\rangle,\n\\mathbf1_{\\{i=j\\}}\\,a(i)(\\langle s,t\\rangle)\\bigr\\rangle:\ns,t\\in\\omega\\land i,j\\in n\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(\\varnothing,0)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle s,t\\rangle,0\\rangle:s,t\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GrassmannianSplitting}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,\\mathrm{BlockSumProjection}_S(a,n)\\rangle:a\\in P_n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ni\\in4\\to\\sigma_i\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle t,\n\\frac{\\sum_{j\\in4}\\delta_{3,i}(t)(j)v_j}{\\|\\sum_{j\\in4}\\delta_{3,i}(t)(j)v_j\\|}\n\\right\\rangle:t\\in\\Delta_2\\right\\},\\\\\nc_2\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,\\textstyle\\sum_{i\\in4}(-1)^i\\mathbf1_{\\{s=\\sigma_i\\}}\\rangle:\ns\\in S_2(S^2,\\tau_{S^2})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi\\coloneqq\\Biggl\\{\\Biggl\\langle x,\n\\Biggl\\{\\Biggl\\langle\\langle i,j\\rangle,\n\\begin{cases}\n(1+x(2))/2,&i=j=0,\\\\\n(1-x(2))/2,&i=j=1,\\\\\n(x(0)-\\mathrm i x(1))/2,&i=0\\land j=1,\\\\\n(x(0)+\\mathrm i x(1))/2,&i=1\\land j=0,\\\\\n0,&\\langle i,j\\rangle\\notin2\\times2\n\\end{cases}\n\\Biggr\\rangle:i,j\\in\\omega\\Biggr\\}\n\\Biggr\\rangle:x\\in S^2\\Biggr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TautologicalLineGenerator}_S(u,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{CohomologyRealization}_S(D,L,\\tau_L)\\land u\\in H_D(2)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{SingularEvaluationPairing}_S(S^2,\\tau_{S^2},2)\n\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{SingularCohomologyPullback}_S(\\chi,S^2,\\tau_{S^2},L,\\tau_L,2)(\\Theta_D(2)(u)),\n[c_2]^{\\mathrm h}_{S^2,\\tau_{S^2},2}\n\\right\\rangle\\right)=-1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"G_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle P,v\\rangle+\\langle P,w\\rangle=\\langle P,v+w\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a\\langle P,v\\rangle=\\langle P,av\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"c_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"x(0)+\\mathrm i x(1)","display":false},{"tex":"-1","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":6282,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f045a36dba6b5ef","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G_n,T_n,\\tau_{G_n},\\tau_{T_n},\\pi_n^0$ 来自 [[58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md]]。该族中 $(\\pi_n^0)^{-1}[\\{P\\}]$ 的运算固定为 $\\langle P,v\\rangle+\\langle P,w\\rangle=\\langle P,v+w\\rangle$、$a\\odot\\langle P,v\\rangle=\\langle P,av\\rangle$；等式按该纤维的所有 $v,w,a$ 全称量化。这些运算不由候选比较映射重选。"},{"id":"8ee356c2b76fa7ec","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L=G_1$、$P_n=L^n$ 及其拓扑、投影 $\\operatorname{pr}_{n,i}$ 采用 [[58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md]] 的显式模型；$\\mathbb{CP}^{\\infty}=L$。$\\iota_n=b_n\\circ\\mathrm{GrassmannianSplitting}_S(n)$。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-332","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md|58-df-complex-grassmannian-data]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["213ce75a48289483","fb6796e83e0c5ef4","ca7fc3ab38a11801","ed44d43cf74ca35e"]}